{"id":"9ec14d57629b7a4c","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md","title":"von Neumann Algebra","display":"df-von-neumann — von Neumann Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-von-neumann","aliases":["58-df-von-neumann","von Neumann Algebra","W*-Algebra"],"display":"df-von-neumann — von Neumann Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-commutant.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-von-neumann"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-von-neumann</span><span>von Neumann Algebra</span><span>W*-Algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-von-neumann — von Neumann Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"051b1a34c565ddef\" href=\"?note=051b1a34c565ddef\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md\">../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad624e4e75f394b\" href=\"?note=2ad624e4e75f394b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-commutant.md\">../batch19/58-df-commutant.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2\\in V\\)</span> (operator algebra and chosen structure data)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Commutant}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Commutant}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebraData}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebraData}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathcal M}=\\{\\langle\\langle S,T\\rangle,S\\circ T\\rangle:S,T\\in\\mathcal M\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathcal M}=\\{\\langle\\langle S,T\\rangle,S\\circ T\\rangle:S,T\\in\\mathcal M\\}\\)</span> 是限制于当前算子集的复合图；不把所有函数上的复合类当作集合运算参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}\\)</span> 在正文中显式约束。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebraData}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,\\iota)\\land\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}\n\\land\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(\\mathcal M,+,\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathcal M},*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal H}\\in\\mathcal M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall T\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal H\\;\n\\bigl(\\iota(T(x),y)=\\iota(x,*(T)(y))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Commutant}_S(\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Commutant}_S(\\mathcal N_2,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\mathcal M=\\mathcal N_2.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebraData}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,\\iota)\\land\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}\n\\land\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(\\mathcal M,+,\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathcal M},*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal H}\\in\\mathcal M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall T\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal H\\;\n\\bigl(\\iota(T(x),y)=\\iota(x,*(T)(y))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Commutant}_S(\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Commutant}_S(\\mathcal N_2,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\mathcal M=\\mathcal N_2.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann}\\vdash\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2\\;\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebraData}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann}\\vdash\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2\\;\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebraData}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>von Neumann: weak* closed C*-subalgebra of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{B}(\\mathcal{H})\">\\(\\mathcal{B}(\\mathcal{H})\\)</span></li>\n<li>Kaplansky density: norm and strong operator topologies agree on unit ball</li>\n<li>Spatial: generated by unitaries <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i\">\\(u_i\\)</span></li>\n<li>Commutation theorem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*(T)&#39; = \\mathcal{B}(\\mathcal{H})&#39;\">\\(C^*(T)&#39; = \\mathcal{B}(\\mathcal{H})&#39;\\)</span> for normal extension</li>\n<li>The two commutants are explicit witnesses, and the involution is required to be the Hilbert-space adjoint; hence the bicommutant equation is not an untyped prime notation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Takesaki, Theory of Operator Algebras</li>\n<li>Kadison and Ringrose, Operator Algebras</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"051b1a34c565ddef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-commutant.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad624e4e75f394b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-commutant.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Commutant}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebraData}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathcal M}=\\{\\langle\\langle S,T\\rangle,S\\circ T\\rangle:S,T\\in\\mathcal M\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebraData}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(\\mathcal H,\\iota)\\land\\mathcal M\\subseteq\\mathcal H^{\\mathcal H}\n\\land\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(\\mathcal M,+,\\mathrm{Comp}_{\\mathcal M},*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal H}\\in\\mathcal M\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall T\\in\\mathcal M\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal H\\;\n\\bigl(\\iota(T(x),y)=\\iota(x,*(T)(y))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Commutant}_S(\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Commutant}_S(\\mathcal N_2,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\mathcal M=\\mathcal N_2.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann}\\vdash\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2\\;\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebraData}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H,\\iota,+,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,\\mathcal N_1,\\mathcal N_2)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{B}(\\mathcal{H})","display":false},{"tex":"u_i","display":false},{"tex":"C^*(T)' = \\mathcal{B}(\\mathcal{H})'","display":false}],"bytes":2616,"backlinks":[{"id":"9f82bb5282bf6867","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the canonical structure-witnessed predicate from [[../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md]]"},{"id":"4329390cb4b96060","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal H)$ (see [[58-df-von-neumann]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1372","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md|58-df-von-neumann]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["051b1a34c565ddef","2ad624e4e75f394b","b70ce791d5b1a19b"]}